{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a shinigami I summoned myself, so there's no worry about me being attacked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I have to think about how to keep <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE> safe, but it's not as if a bright idea for that is coming to me right now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
