{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went into the house and sat on the sofa.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had also thought about going straight back to the police station and telling them about the curse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I can't imagine a story like that getting through to the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, those two are at the police station right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shinigami or not, going on a rampage inside a police station... 
{PAUSE ""}
can I really say it wouldn't happen?<PG>
Even as I sat there, time kept slipping by.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it a mistake after all, taking <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> to the park that time?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did I make the wrong choice?<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is <STYLE ID="1">she</STYLE> up to right now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's probably investigating the incident after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hasn't she gotten hold of some information that could lead to solving it?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It's <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
Did she find something out?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even so, what should I say?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I told her about the curse, there's no way she'd believe it so easily.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
While I hesitated, the phone went quiet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once the phone actually stopped ringing, I realized that like this, I'd get nowhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
That's right, whether she believes it or not doesn't matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I first tell her I'm involved in the incident, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> should understand a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll have to confess that I'm the culprit of the Megasawa City case, but the one thing I absolutely can't stand is <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> dying...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hi-iii, it's Goto!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An awfully cheerful voice from <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all that dark talk earlier, something about it was unnatural.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. What's up? Find out anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to keep my <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="こわいろ">tone of voice</STYLE> as normal as I could, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, it's not exactly that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But, being alone, I'm scared after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I'd heard before that <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s parents were going to a class reunion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh... So </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're home alone right now. You did say before that your parents had a class reunion. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm alone right now, too. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s coming home late today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Aren't your parents worried? On a day when an incident like that happened, their </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> alone at home?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh... no, I called them just now, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm. Well, make sure you lock up tight."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd just been warned about locking up by <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, but it's <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, more than me, who should be careful to lock up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes... but it's scary after all, isn't it, when something like this happens so close by."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, actually, I was wondering whether to call you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, too. And then I got a call from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> I'm not, but being alone does make me feel uneasy after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> wasn't getting around to talking about the heart of the incident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I can't imagine <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> calling over something that's just small talk...<PG>
Yeah, that has to be it. At the very least, she must have figured out about my dad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little searching online is enough to find out that 12 years ago, a man named Eiichiro Niimura died in Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I should probably be the one to move the conversation forward.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was nervous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to just blurt it out on momentum, but when it came to actually saying it, I didn't know how to explain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to say it in a way that's as easy as possible for <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> to hear.<PG>
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Can I ask you one weird question?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why... did you call me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This should make it easier to bring it up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Feeling uneasy alone, that's not like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Even though earlier you were so fired up, saying you wanted to solve the incident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Ah... ah... do you think so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's wrong, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>? Why is your voice shaking so much?<PG>
Could it be she really is feeling uneasy being alone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I make a bit more small talk and let some time pass?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Something?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Something, like... what?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Ah... um... uh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>Something was definitely off with <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her voice shaking like this, talking to me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means she's figured out not just about my dad, but that the culprit is me!?<PG>
Damn...! Stop chickening out already, me!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's the point of being scared of getting found out as the culprit now!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come on, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, suspect me!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm the culprit! I'm a murderer!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You know that, don't you!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? Could it be, you're scared of me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> being this scared means... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">could it be, you found something out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No doubt about it, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> has realized I'm the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So all that's left is to wait for <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> to say it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving it to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> should be faster.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What, no answer at all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Se... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Se..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>"Hmm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hurry up and say it...! <STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> have to be the one to take charge!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"N-no, sorry! For once </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> were scared, so I thought I'd tease you, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Doing that at a time like this was too insensitive, I guess! Ahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't bear it anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a mistake to begin with, relying on <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and trying to make her do the talking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, talking with me, the culprit, would take a lot of courage.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's nothing! Nothing... Don't worry about it, okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"U-uh-huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry! Really, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! I'm gonna hang up. The mood got weird somehow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Tomorrow, let's go see how </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s doing! Good night!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Dammit...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
This leaves me with no moves at all!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no time, I can't rely on the police, and I can't tell <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> either!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What am I supposed to do all by myself...!<PG>
Tears spilled out on their own, stirring up my frustration even more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't care anymore! <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, help me...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, help me”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sending a message like this was all I could do now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If you're scared to get involved with me, then just save <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>, even if it's <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> alone!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A reply came from <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> right away.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">“What's the matter? Are you all right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">“At this rate, I'm going to end up killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. Help me. Help </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. I don't want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. Help me.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
